<doc id="197839" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=197839" title="HMS Java (1811)">
HMS Java (1811)

<ol>
<li>ALIH</<li>
</ol>
HMS Java iku sawijiné baita frégat Angkatan Laut Krajan Britani &lt;a href="Royal%20Navy"&gt;Royal Navy&lt;/a&gt; 38-gun &lt;a href="fifth-rate"&gt;fifth-rate&lt;/a&gt;. Asliné jenengé Renommée ing taun 1805, described as a 40-gun &lt;a href="French%20Navy"&gt;French Navy&lt;/a&gt; frigate, but the vessel actually carried 46 guns. The British captured her in 1811 in a noteworthy action during the &lt;a href="Battle%20of%20Tamatave"&gt;Battle of Tamatave&lt;/a&gt;, but she is most famous for her defeat on 29 December 1812 in a three-hour &lt;a href="single-ship%20action"&gt;single-ship action&lt;/a&gt; against &lt;a href="USS%26%2332%3BConstitution"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. Java had a &lt;a href="Ship%27s%20company"&gt;complement&lt;/a&gt; of about 277, but during her engagement with Constitution she allegedly had 426 aboard, in comparison with her opponent's 475.
